        "output_types": "\"tuple - A tuple containing two elements: (1) a dictionary mapping each detected label to a list of detection entries, e.g. {'baseball': [{'box': (x1, y1, x2, y2), 'score': 0.95, 'saved_image_path': 'path/to/saved/image.png'}]}, (2) a dictionary mapping each label to the number of detected objects in the image. e.g. {'baseball': 2, 'basket': 1}\".\n"
    },
]

